# This build trusts no release signing key.
#
# Replace these lines with the two-line public key that `minisign -G -W`
# printed for the release signing keypair, and `auto_update = true` becomes a
# config the loader accepts rather than one it refuses.
#
# The secret key belongs in the `MINISIGN_SECRET_KEY` Actions secret and
# nowhere else in this repository. docs/release.md §2 is the procedure, and it
# is written to be followed once.
